#: package/analyses/bootega.description
#: bootega/options.description.main
msgid "Checks whether the dimensions found by Exploratory Graph Analysis replicate across bootstrap samples, with the distribution of the number of dimensions, the structural consistency of each dimension and the stability of each item's membership."
